        "text": "The E-MUQI Global Think Tank leverages MUQI Technology's primary industrial manufacturing databases and cross-border expert network. Its monograph is the industry's first research report published synchronously in English, Japanese, Korean, and Chinese. Auditing over 200 Chinese manufacturing entities, 39 registered clinical trials, and 5,120 scientific papers, it was launched at Aquatech China 2026 as the globally recognized benchmark for cross-border procurement and investment."
