      "isPartOf": { "@type": "WebPage", "@id": "https://www.emuqi.com/zh/blog/european-hydrogen-water-cases.html" },
      "headline": "氢水有没有用？欧洲已经跑完两个真实案例，档案在这里",
      "description": "欧洲市场上两个真实氢水品牌与大学合作的双盲交叉试验全档案对照：英国HtoEAU（NCT06788015）与捷克Nutristamina（NCT05799911），深入剖析0.6%变动、SWC与Cohen's d效应量、阴性结果与科学可证伪性。",
      "image": "https://www.emuqi.com/assets/images/blog/european-hydrogen-water-cases/fig5-cover.png",
      "datePublished": "2026-10-17T09:00:00+08:00",
      "dateModified": "2026-10-17T18:30:00+08:00",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "欧洲氢医学观察 / 深度科学组"
      },
      "publisher": { "@id": "https://www.emuqi.com/#organization" },
